  reel_script says the fraud was 'இயந்திரம் வாங்கித் தருவதாக ரூ.2 கோடிக்கு மேல்' - article gives Rs 2.64 crore loan, so 'over Rs 2 crore' is loosely consistent, but reel_script states Meena was arrested 'நேற்று முன்தினம்' while the article's arrest day is the same; no error there
  reel_script says Manni's house deed was taken and that Manni 'தனது நிறுவனத்தின் பெயரில் கடன் பெற்று' and money was sent to Meena and Sankar 'இயந்திரம் வாங்குவதற்குப் பதிலாக' - article says the loan was taken in the name of VS Technology via a sales invoice, not Manni's company; the reel_script attributes the loan to Manni's company, which is a factual error
  reel_script omits that the money passed through the company owner Justin Prabhakar and the Rs 10 lakh commission taken by Meena, and that Rs 2 crore was sent to Sankar - the transfer chain is missing
  slides_spec and caption describe Manni as the one who 'அக்டோபரில் புகார் அளித்தார்' - correct, but slide 'என்ன நடந்தது?' says 'வழக்குப் பதிவு செய்தனர்' which the article does not state
